  "description": "The opt-in bridge that makes SetNet.Mobs advance mob positions through the unified SetNet.Locomotion tick instead of their own path-follower: loco.AsMobMover() → MobOptions.Mover. Mob AI/perception/threat/combat/replication are unchanged; only the movement stepping moves into the one shared system, so players and mobs share it (and its Started hook, for L2-style \"send the point\" replication). Depends on SetNet.Mobs + SetNet.Locomotion.",
